{"about_the_game":"You just got hired at the biggest game studio out there... can you make all the way through the <strong>Toxic Trenches</strong>, the <strong>Congregation of Creative</strong>, the <strong>Development Hive</strong>, and the <strong>Management Gallows</strong>? Build your deck of skills, discover powerful new talents, battle workplace challenges, manage your sanity, and Crush the Industry! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098610/extras/overlordGif1c.gif?t=1741053738\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>High Replayability</strong>: Multiple playable characters, <strong>200+ skills/talents</strong>, and an ever-changing schedule ensure that <strong>every career run will be unique</strong>.  <br></li><li><strong>Fresh Mechanics</strong>: The <strong>rolling health</strong> system will keep you on your toes while your <strong>sanity</strong> may result in unpredictable effects...<br></li><li><strong>Customize Your Playstyle</strong>: Whether you want to take your time planning carefully or play in the fast lane, you've got options. <br></li><li><strong>Challenging Progression</strong>: Test your limits in Hard Mode and traverse the <strong>9 Circles of Corporate Hell</strong>! <br></li><li><strong>Unlocked Potential</strong>: Unlock new content as you achieve milestones. <br></li><li><strong>Strange Company</strong>: The <strong>40+ unique battle encounters</strong> include everything from toxic players and creative blocks to poorly-optimized code and grotesque meeting blobs!<br></li><li><strong>Labor of Love</strong>: Built by a couple who are passionate about retro games. </li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Jack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1098610/231b1e6a64ba4f8ca1020cf976cb6dfe068e81c0.jpg"},{"name":"FIRED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image